message: If you use this archive, please cite it as below.
title: "Yueju Linguistic Archive (越剧档案)"
authors:
  - family-names: Chan
    given-names: Alice
type: software
abstract: >-
  An academic web archive for Yue opera (越剧) linguistic materials with
  timed transcripts and layered Chinese/English dialogue. Curated English
  is the authoritative translation layer; machine translation is labeled
  and non-authoritative.
keywords:
  - Yue opera
  - 越剧
  - Shaoxing
  - Wu Chinese
  - linguistic archive
  - ASR
  - multilingual transcript
